LiveKit should NOT become our application's main database.

Our database should store things such as:

```
users
meetings
meeting_members
roles
permissions
```

Suggested conceptual structure:

```
users
----------------
id
name
...

meetings
----------------
id
room_name
created_by
status
created_at
...

meeting_members
----------------
meeting_id
user_id
role
...
```

The exact schema should follow the existing project's conventions.

