# 13. Environment Variables

Use environment variables/secrets.

Conceptually:

```
LIVEKIT_URL=ws://localhost:7880
LIVEKIT_API_KEY=...
LIVEKIT_API_SECRET=...
```

Production will later use something similar to:

```
LIVEKIT_URL=wss://livekit.example.com
LIVEKIT_API_KEY=production-key
LIVEKIT_API_SECRET=production-secret
```

The exact production secret-management mechanism should be selected during AWS deployment.

Never hardcode secrets.

Never commit secrets to Git.

Never return the API secret to clients.

